    "    \\caption{Trajectory norm $\\|\\mathbf{x}_k\\|$ versus step index $k$ at\n",
    "    $h = 0.5$ for the uncoupled schedule ($s_k \\equiv 0$), the damped\n",
    "    full-coupling schedule ($s_k \\equiv 1$, $\\beta = 1/4$), and the undamped\n",
    "    full-coupling schedule ($s_k \\equiv 1$, $\\beta = 1$), with\n",
    "    $\\mathbf{A}=\\operatorname{diag}(-1,-2)$ and $\\mathbf{P}$ the\n",
    "    transposition. The undamped curve diverges; the uncoupled and damped\n",
    "    curves remain bounded. The damped curve decays more slowly than the\n",
    "    uncoupled one, consistent with the larger stability window at\n",
